sequenceDiagram
    actor Engineer
    participant DockerDB as PostgreSQL (Docker)
    participant RDS_DB as AWS RDS PostgreSQL
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant User
    participant ALB as AWS ALB (HTTPS)
    participant EC2 as EC2 Instance (HTTP)

    rect rgb(173, 216, 230)
        Note over Engineer, KC: DB Migration
        Engineer->>DockerDB: 1: Export Keycloak data
        DockerDB-->>Engineer: Provides data dump
        Engineer->>RDS_DB: 2: Import Keycloak data
        RDS_DB-->>Engineer: Import successful
        Engineer->>KC: 3: Reconfigure DB connection to point to RDS
        KC->>RDS_DB: Establishes new connection
    end

    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over Engineer, EC2: Secure Networking
        Engineer->>ALB: 4: Provision ALB & ACM Certificate
        User->>+ALB: 5: Accesses app via https://app.yourdomain.com
        ALB->>-EC2: 6: Forwards traffic via HTTP to EC2 instance
        Note over User, EC2: All subsequent traffic is now secure (HTTPS)
    end